('Australia & New Zealand', 'Australia', 'MARS / Melbourne Animal Referral Services', 'Oncology team (Paul Crocker is a team member)', 'Paul Crocker is listed as lead oncology veterinarian; the telehealth page does not guarantee he personally conducts the video consultation.', 'Owner; vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Secure video case review for owners and referring veterinarians, followed by an individual written plan sent to both. Email history and test results to enquiries@marsvets.com.au; the service page schedules Thursday/Friday. Official 2025–26 oncology tariff: AUD 300 including GST (confirm current price). Eligible countries and the assigned clinician are not specified.', 'https://marsvets.com.au/services/vet-cancer-care-telehealth/', 'https://marsvets.com.au/about-us/meet-the-team/', 'Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('Australia & New Zealand', 'Australia', 'Animal Cancer Centre WA', 'Jessica Finlay', 'BVSc, MVS, FANZCVS (Veterinary Oncology); registered oncology specialist, founder, medical oncology residency, research and teaching.', 'Owner with vet', 'Medical oncology', 'Referral-based Zoom consultations for most cases; this specialist practice does not accept primary-care consultations. Initial consultations are 45 minutes; Zoom recordings are available in the patient portal with permission. Booking may precede receipt of referral records. Contact (08) 6556 9901 or letstalk@animalcancercentrewa.com.au. Fee and cross-border eligibility are not published.', 'https://animalcancercentrewa.com.au/the-journey/', 'https://animalcancercentrewa.com.au/the-family/', 'Named clinician; confirm booking'),
