('United States', 'United States', 'DVM STAT', 'Michelle Silver and Ester Yang (oncology team)', 'Both hold DACVIM (Oncology). Silver completed an oncology residency at New England Veterinary Oncology Group after clinical-trial work; Yang completed her residency at Virginia-Maryland College of Veterinary Medicine and teaches at Penn. Confirm which specialist accepts a particular case.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Treating veterinarians submit patient history, diagnostics, images and clinical questions through the clinic platform. Oncology review includes a tailored written staging and treatment report, with follow-up case support. Telephone options use the service STAT line (833-386-7828); confirm oncology availability. Fee and eligible countries/states are not published.', 'https://www.dvmstat.com/oncology', 'https://www.dvmstat.com/specialists', 'Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('United States', 'United States', 'University of Florida Small Animal Hospital', 'Paulo Vilar Saavedra (oncology service chief)', 'DVM, MSc, PhD, DACVIM (Oncology); medical oncology residency at Michigan State University and Virginia Tech. Research interests include clinical trials, immunotherapy and individualized treatment. The referral form does not name the responding doctor.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Referring veterinarians can request a patient-specific oncology consultation by phone or email using the medical oncology form. Upload relevant records as one compressed ZIP (maximum 125 MB); send ultrasound/CT DICOM files in reply to the confirmation email. The responding clinician, owner participation, fee and geographic eligibility are not specified.', 'https://smallanimal.vethospital.ufl.edu/contact-us/referring-veterinarians/for-referring-veterinarians-medical-oncology-referral-form/', 'https://www.vetmed.ufl.edu/profile/vilar-saavedra-paulo/', 'Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('United States','United States','Veterinary Oncology Partners','M.J. Hamilton (co-founder)','DVM, DACVIM (Oncology); board-certified medical oncologist, oncology department builder and clinical-trial participant. Other founders have small animal internal medicine rather than oncology board credentials. The case reviewer is not identified in advance.','Vet only','Medical oncology','Written case-specific cancer opinion and treatment options submitted and received by the primary veterinarian; no direct owner consultation. Consultations available across US states; chemotherapy fulfillment has a narrower state list. Fee on request.','https://www.veterinaryoncologypartners.com/pet-owners.html','https://www.veterinaryoncologypartners.com/our-story.html','Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('United States', 'United States', 'West Texas Veterinary Specialists', 'Avenelle Turner (team oncologist)', 'DVM, DACVIM (Oncology); Colorado State DVM, Gulf Coast oncology residency; former oncology service chief and clinical-trial investigator. Her personal assignment to a submitted case is not guaranteed.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Veterinarian-only written oncology review using history, physical examination findings, diagnostics and imaging. The local veterinarian discusses the report and provides hands-on care. WTVS serves West Texas practices and explicitly offers teleconsultations to practices outside its mobile travel area; eligible states/countries are not enumerated. Contact info@txvetspecialty.com or use the consultation portal. Fee not published.', 'https://txvetspecialty.com/services/oncology/', 'https://txvetspecialty.com/dr-turner/', 'Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('Other Americas','Canada','Balto / ANI.ML Health','Specialist team (co-founder Christopher Pinard)','Christopher Pinard, DVM, DVSc, DACVIM (Oncology), is a Toronto medical oncologist and ANI.ML co-founder; his participation as a Balto case reviewer is not established. The service does not name the oncology consultant assigned to a case.','Vet only','Medical oncology','A veterinarian submits the cancer case online and receives a written specialist report, advertised within 24 hours. Owner cannot book a live oncology conversation through this service; ask who reviews the case and confirm price and coverage.','https://consult.animl.health/','https://www.uoguelph.ca/ovc/clinical-studies/faculty/christopher-pinard','Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('Australia & New Zealand', 'Australia', 'Veterinary Oncology Consultants', 'Penny Thomas and Amy Lane (current profiled consulting team); Anthony Moore and Angela Frimberger are identified as founders', 'Veterinary oncology consulting team; Penny Thomas and Amy Lane hold FANZCVS oncology credentials. Review individual biographies before booking.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Worldwide veterinarian-only case review with a written report. Initial email consultation AUD 300; report plus veterinarian phone consultation AUD 350; follow-up AUD 35 per contact; individual chemotherapy protocol AUD 50. Australian fees include 10% GST. New clinic clients should contact the service before submitting the form and send relevant test results. Consulting hours: Monday–Friday, 8am–3pm NSW time.', 'https://www.vetoncologyconsults.com/oncology-consulting/', 'https://www.vetoncologyconsults.com/about/', 'Team; confirm assigned clinician'),
('Australia & New Zealand', 'Australia', 'Online Oncologist', 'Sonya Yu', 'BVSc, FANZCVS (Veterinary Oncology); consulting for primary veterinarians.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Veterinarian-only oncology consulting. Hong Kong tariff: HKD 1,800 per case; follow-up HKD 500 and chemotherapy protocol HKD 250 are separate. Monthly plans: HKD 7,000 for three cases or HKD 10,000 for five, including follow-up, protocols and handouts. Subscriber Microsoft Teams messaging support is advertised Monday–Friday, 9am–5pm AEST; this is not a promised owner video appointment. HK contact: joseph@onlineoncologist.vet / WhatsApp +852 5741 9350. Other country eligibility requires a region-specific offering.', 'https://www.onlineoncologist.vet/hong-kong', 'https://www.onlineoncologist.vet/about', 'Named consultant'),
('Other Americas', 'Brazil', 'Onco Cats', 'Gabriela Clezar (practice lead); confirm assigned remote consultant', 'Gabriela Clezar is a veterinarian with published specializations in veterinary oncology and feline medicine. An ACVIM/ECVIM oncology board credential is not established; confirm the assigned consultant.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Veterinarian-facing online oncology and feline-medicine consultancy/teleinterconsultation through the treating veterinarian. Contact WhatsApp +55 (48) 99800-4811. The exact remote format, fee and eligible countries are not published; no direct owner video appointment is established.', 'https://www.oncocats.com/', 'https://www.oncocats.com/conhe%C3%A7a-mais', 'Clinician not named'),
('Europe', 'Germany', 'Vetonc', 'Franziska Hergt', 'DipECVIM-CA (Oncology); oncology specialist providing consultations to veterinarians.', 'Vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Veterinarian-facing oncology case review by email or telephone, including interpretation of findings, staging, treatment options and prognosis. Contact info@vetonc.de. Direct owner teleconsultation is not advertised; fee, required document checklist and eligible countries are not published.', 'https://vetonc.de/', 'https://vetonc.de/', 'Named consultant'),
('Europe', 'France', 'Onkolia', 'Paul Ghislain', 'Veterinarian, CEAV de Médecine Interne des Animaux de Compagnie; Diplôme d’École en Cancérologie / Capacité en chimiothérapie anticancéreuse vétérinaire; ESVONC member. These are not an established ECVIM/ACVIM oncology diplomate credential.', 'Owner with vet; vet only', 'Oncology advice (internal-medicine and cancer-training qualifications; oncology board certification not established)', 'Owners referred by their veterinarian may submit the medical dossier; veterinarians may request an opinion directly. A written PDF opinion goes to the treating veterinarian; it is not a direct owner video appointment, remote diagnosis or prescription. Single opinion EUR 129 including VAT, advertised within five working days with one Q&A exchange; three-month package EUR 389, annual package EUR 649. Contact contact@onkolia.fr. Eligible countries are not listed.', 'https://www.onkolia.fr/articles/avis-cancerologique-veterinaire-distance-confrere', 'https://www.onkolia.fr/a-propos', 'Named reviewer; written opinion in support of treating veterinarian'),
('Australia & New Zealand','New Zealand','ARC Vets','Patrick Smith','DipECVIM-CA (Oncology); clinical interest in lymphoma.','Vet only; owner follow-up','Medical oncology','Initial remote expert discussion is through the referring veterinarian; owner remote follow-up is possible where appropriate.','https://arcvets.co.nz/services/oncology-cancer-care/','https://arcvets.co.nz/services/oncology-cancer-care/','Named clinician; confirm booking'),
('Europe', 'United Kingdom', 'VOS — Veterinary Specialists', 'Katarzyna Purzycka', 'DVM, MVetMed, MRCVS, DipACVIM (Oncology); American and RCVS recognised specialist in veterinary oncology. Confirm the assigned consultant.', 'Owner with vet; vet only', 'Medical oncology', 'Patient-specific oncology review for dogs and cats: written report (£70; within four working days), or 40-minute online consultation for an owner or veterinarian (£70 each) with a short written summary. Polish and English. Submit history, current medication, examination findings and relevant tests through the oncology case form; owner consultation summary goes to the referring veterinarian. Official terms describe worldwide remote service, subject to local licensing and a locally licensed veterinarian implementing advice. Contact through the official contact form.', 'https://vos-ltd.vet/en/oncology-submission/', 'https://vos-ltd.vet/en/about-us/', 'Named specialist listed; confirm assigned consultant'),
('Europe', 'Germany', 'Stefan Scharvogel – surgical-oncology case review', 'Stefan Scharvogel', 'Diplomate ECVS; national surgical and small-animal specialist. Surgical qualifications; no medical or radiation oncology board credential claimed.', 'Owner; vet only', 'Cancer surgery', 'Remote review of surgical-oncology cases and selected radiographs where appropriate for dogs and cats. Owners and veterinarians may contact info@scharvogel.com or +49 151 74241683; replies may be delayed during travel. Platform, fee, duration and document checklist are not published. Confirm geographic/licensing eligibility: the owner FAQ restricts curative activity outside Bavaria/Baden-Württemberg, while the current site names physical clinics within those states. Remote advice does not establish unrestricted cross-border treatment.', 'https://scharvogel.com/', 'https://scharvogel.com/', 'Named surgical consultant; confirm case suitability and eligibility'),
